  "upstream": [],
  "delta": [
    "P05/P16/P26: exact MCP routes require X-PDSH-MCP-Egress equal to the host-generated PDSH_MCP_EGRESS_TOKEN; missing, empty, wrong, placeholder and case-shifted values are rejected before credential injection or upstream contact (PC-20261110-bot-mcp-egress-capability).",
    "P26: /identity/register uses the host-issued session credential, not the caller-supplied sessionId; tokens are resolved through the BotTokenRegistry model (revoked and expired tokens are absent) and the principal sessionId must match.",
    "P26: after tools/call attribution, the bare tool must be in the same per-caller catalog tools/list returns; only CreateTeammate is hidden from non-main callers, and unknown names stay unknown_tool.",
    "P05/P26: Bot network writes are approved at the host /v1/http exit by host + method (POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE), never by command text; GET/HEAD and exact configured model endpoints keep the matrix behaviour. write/edit are auto inside the Bot workspace root and directory-granular outside it (PC-20261111-bot-egress-approval)."
  ],
  "egressToken": "wpf0-fixture-egress-token",
  "egressRoutes": [
